# Consuming Aberration: an opponent with no land card in their library reveals all of it and puts every card into their graveyard.
# Bot2's library holds a Lightning Bolt, an Ornithopter and a Memnite when Bot1 casts an Ornithopter: all three are
# milled, the library is empty, and the Aberration (1/1 with Bot2's own Bolt in its graveyard) is a 4/4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Consuming Aberration
Ornithopter
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x5
Island
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Memnite

